OL,3,GNEWSAMan on cocaine who stole minibus
OL,4,Aand drove wrong way on dual carriageway
OL,5,Ajailed
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man who stole a minibus while under
OL,8,Fthe influence of cocaine and alcohol,
OL,9,Fbefore hitting and injuring a cyclist,
OL,10,Fthen driving the wrong way on a dual
OL,11,Fcarriageway, has been jailed.
OL,13,FDarragh O'Grady, 31, from Dublin,
OL,14,Farrived by ferry in Holyhead, Anglesey,
OL,15,Fwhere he stole a woman's mobile phone
OL,16,Fand her bank cards that he used to
OL,17,Fspend between #100 and #200.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
