OL,3,GNEWSAMan on cocaine who stole minibus
OL,4,Aand drove wrong way on dual carriageway
OL,5,Ajailed
OL,6,
OL,7,FJailing O'Grady for three years at
OL,8,FCaernarfon Crown Court, Judge Betts
OL,9,Fsaid it was "only a matter of sheer
OL,10,Fluck that you didn't kill yourself or
OL,11,Fsomeone else".
OL,13,FO'Grady had admitted taking cocaine and
OL,14,FValium, as well as drinking alcohol. He
OL,15,Falso said he had a history of mental
OL,16,Fillness and episodes of schizophrenia.
